### Variáveis (troque para a URL do Azure quando publicar)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api

### Listar
GET {{baseUrl}}/cryptos

### Buscar por texto
GET {{baseUrl}}/cryptos?search=bit

### Cadastrar
POST {{baseUrl}}/cryptos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bitcoin", "symbol": "BTC" }

### Detalhar (troque o id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cryptos/000000000000000000000000

### Editar (troque o id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cryptos/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bitcoin", "symbol": "XBT" }

### Excluir (troque o id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cryptos/000000000000000000000000
